  40:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****             (+++) Enable the NVIC USART IRQ handle.
  41:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_uart.c ****         (++) UART interrupts handling:
